WEBVTT

00:17.820 --> 00:20.270
Er... for you.

00:24.820 --> 00:27.830
<i>It's the lap blanket 
I gave her for Christmas.</i>

00:30.390 --> 00:32.880
It doesn't bother me at all.

00:34.710 --> 00:37.480
Any time I'm with you...

00:38.570 --> 00:42.060
I feel strangely warm inside.

00:43.530 --> 00:45.030
Thank you.

00:46.090 --> 00:49.060
Why are you thanking me?

00:49.060 --> 00:52.400
Well... that's a good question.

00:52.400 --> 00:54.640
I just wanted to say it, I suppose.

00:55.060 --> 00:58.650
I should be the one thanking you, 
of course. Thank you.

01:00.060 --> 01:02.640
<i>She's even using it at the office?</i>

01:07.700 --> 01:10.400
It's still very warm.

01:13.920 --> 01:17.920
Fuyutsuki-san! Can I borrow you for a sec?

01:18.320 --> 01:19.430
Of course.

01:23.680 --> 01:27.440
Sorry, but this part of that document...

01:27.440 --> 01:28.410
Yes?

01:28.410 --> 01:30.990
<i>Fuyutsuki-san's birthday is coming up.</i>

01:35.920 --> 01:37.840
Thank you very much!

01:41.420 --> 01:44.200
Really? No way!

01:44.200 --> 01:48.130
There's nothing worse than getting 
accessories you didn't ask for!

01:48.130 --> 01:49.720
Totally.

01:49.720 --> 01:52.680
And it feels so pushy if we're not dating.

01:53.260 --> 01:55.460
That should cover it, I think.

02:00.440 --> 02:05.460
<i>I still haven't given her 
the present I bought then.</i>

02:06.420 --> 02:08.010
<i>Pathetic.</i>

02:08.440 --> 02:10.510
Hey, Himuro!

02:10.510 --> 02:13.240
This is your big chance to give it to her!

02:13.240 --> 02:16.030
Show her that go-for-broke snowball spirit!

02:16.030 --> 02:17.810
Go for it, Himuro!

02:18.440 --> 02:20.240
I broke!

02:20.580 --> 02:22.730
I don't want to break, but...

02:23.090 --> 02:24.380
Yeah.

02:24.380 --> 02:27.240
I'm gonna give it my best!

02:28.000 --> 02:29.960
<b>The Ice Guy and</b>

02:28.000 --> 02:29.960
<b>The Ice Guy and</b>

02:28.000 --> 02:29.960
<b>The Ice Guy and</b>

02:28.000 --> 02:29.960
<b>The Ice Guy and</b>

