02:36.340 --> 02:40.800
<b>His Cool Female Colleague</b>

02:37.840 --> 02:40.800
<b>Episode 10


Sleepover in the Storm!!</b>

02:37.840 --> 02:40.800
<b>Episode 10


Sleepover in the Storm!!</b>

04:04.980 --> 04:08.470
A downpour so early in the new year...

04:08.750 --> 04:10.600
Depressing, huh?

04:10.600 --> 04:12.670
Not to mention the wind.

04:13.220 --> 04:15.190
Himuro!

04:16.040 --> 04:17.680
What is it, Katori?

04:18.500 --> 04:20.780
Wow, you're soaked.

04:21.460 --> 04:23.510
I've been doing my rounds.

04:23.510 --> 04:24.730
With Otonashi-san!

04:24.730 --> 04:26.640
In weather like this?

04:26.640 --> 04:28.750
Sales is a tough business.

04:29.080 --> 04:32.240
I don't mind if I'm with Otonashi-san!

04:32.240 --> 04:35.690
Oh, what a mess!

04:35.690 --> 04:37.120
Otonashi-san!

04:37.120 --> 04:38.640
Welcome back.

04:39.250 --> 04:41.160
This is awful.

04:41.160 --> 04:45.260
It's freezing and I'm soaked, 
and the trains have stopped running.

04:45.260 --> 04:47.960
What, already?!

04:47.960 --> 04:49.540
That's a problem.

04:49.930 --> 04:52.570
The transfer buses will be
 crowded, in that case.

04:52.570 --> 04:54.280
What'll we do?

04:54.710 --> 04:58.610
We won't have an easy time getting
 back home, I'll tell you that much.

05:00.640 --> 05:01.980
I know!

05:02.540 --> 05:06.520
Why don't we stay at that 
business hotel near the station?

05:08.480 --> 05:10.570
That might be nice.

05:10.570 --> 05:13.470
Stay with us, Otonashi-san!

05:15.110 --> 05:17.540
Well... that might just work.

05:17.540 --> 05:21.750
Yeah! A big sleepover!

05:21.750 --> 05:25.980
Oh, but will your kitty be okay 
without you, Fuyutsuki-san?

05:25.980 --> 05:27.630
For food and stuff, I mean.

05:27.630 --> 05:30.060
Nyamero will be fine.

05:34.340 --> 05:36.560
I have an automatic feeder.

05:38.640 --> 05:42.660
Lucky! Wish I could join in.

05:42.660 --> 05:47.310
Didn't you just move to a place 
a five-minute walk from the office?

05:48.160 --> 05:49.820
I won't allow it.

05:51.720 --> 05:55.320
Well, it's nice that you live close.

05:55.320 --> 05:59.690
Would you mind letting me stay 
with you for the night, then?

05:59.690 --> 06:01.580
I can't get home if the trains aren't running.

06:01.580 --> 06:03.250
Yeah, sure thing.

06:03.750 --> 06:05.690
How about you, Saejima-kun?

06:05.690 --> 06:07.080
Wanna hang?

06:07.080 --> 06:09.040
Oh, can I?

06:09.040 --> 06:11.090
I'd appreciate that.

06:11.090 --> 06:14.680
Okay! Let's play games at my place!

06:19.100 --> 06:21.600
All right, let's battle!

06:21.600 --> 06:23.390
You think you can beat me?

06:23.390 --> 06:26.320
Oh? You're a gamer, Saejima-kun?

06:27.290 --> 06:29.370
Pretty sure I got this.

06:29.370 --> 06:31.500
Okay, let's do it!

06:31.500 --> 06:32.630
Take that!

06:33.920 --> 06:38.040
<i>I wonder what Fuyutsuki-san's 
planning for her birthday.</i>

06:40.990 --> 06:46.080
I'm scared! Thunder is scary!

06:46.080 --> 06:49.880
Komori-san, you're frightened of thunder?

06:50.360 --> 06:54.130
How are you guys not freaked out?

06:54.130 --> 06:56.810
Well, it's just a loud noise.

06:56.810 --> 06:58.900
It's not that different from fireworks.

06:58.900 --> 07:01.470
Well, I like fireworks...

07:01.470 --> 07:03.640
But I seriously can't stand thunder.

07:04.160 --> 07:10.840
Nyamero was frightened of thunder 
as a kitten, but not anymore.

07:10.840 --> 07:12.900
I'm sure you'll also—

07:15.920 --> 07:18.160
I hate it!

07:19.330 --> 07:23.160
<i>Kitten Nyamero...</i>

07:25.950 --> 07:27.660
Komori-san.

07:29.800 --> 07:34.080
The next time thunder scares you, call me.

07:34.830 --> 07:39.190
I'll come running anytime, anywhere.

07:40.330 --> 07:42.440
Fuyutsuki-san...

07:42.440 --> 07:44.070
What are you, her boyfriend?

07:47.820 --> 07:49.320
Honestly...

07:49.320 --> 07:51.680
Don't you have a boyfriend 
already, Komori-san?

07:51.680 --> 07:52.820
Huh?!

07:54.030 --> 07:56.700
You're in a relationship, Komori-san?

07:57.120 --> 07:59.700
But you already have me...

07:59.700 --> 08:04.790
N-No, I'm not! This is 
the first I've heard of it!

08:07.490 --> 08:09.400
You know the one.

08:09.400 --> 08:12.960
The guy in your department... Saejima-kun.

08:14.470 --> 08:16.470
It's not like that!

08:16.470 --> 08:18.390
He's totally not...

08:18.390 --> 08:19.720
He's not?

08:19.720 --> 08:23.720
But you got lunch together 
recently, didn't you?

08:27.000 --> 08:30.490
I happened to catch a glimpse 
while I was doing my rounds.

08:32.550 --> 08:34.230
Well?

08:34.230 --> 08:36.480
Th-That was just...

08:36.480 --> 08:40.240
We happened to stop by the 
same restaurant on our break...

08:40.240 --> 08:42.120
Is that <i>really</i> all?

08:42.120 --> 08:43.990
Yeah, that's really all!

08:46.480 --> 08:47.920
Are you cold?

08:48.380 --> 08:50.410
Should I turn up the heat?

08:50.410 --> 08:52.940
No, I'm okay.

08:52.940 --> 08:56.000
Why aren't you sitting, Himuro?

08:56.000 --> 08:56.870
Oh, well...

08:56.870 --> 08:58.720
Katori-san, we've got incoming!

09:00.010 --> 09:04.520
A-And what about you, then, Otonashi-san?!

09:04.520 --> 09:07.240
You've got love confessions 
pouring in, right?!

09:07.240 --> 09:09.500
From that phoenix guy...

09:10.080 --> 09:13.030
Phoenix? You mean Katori?

09:13.030 --> 09:15.560
Who else could I mean?!

09:15.560 --> 09:19.040
He spends all day following you around!

09:19.550 --> 09:22.450
It's really not like that.

09:22.450 --> 09:25.040
He's just the junior I'm mentoring.

09:29.040 --> 09:30.620
You getting a cold?

09:30.620 --> 09:33.640
Nah, I never get colds.

09:33.640 --> 09:35.440
Truly a phoenix.

09:35.440 --> 09:38.140
Seriously, Himuro, what are you up to?

09:38.140 --> 09:43.800
Oh, just... Fuyutsuki-san...

09:43.800 --> 09:48.540
Suspicious! Why not just come clean already?

09:48.540 --> 09:50.050
About what?

09:50.050 --> 09:53.200
You guys are super close and cozy, right?

09:53.200 --> 09:56.700
I think you're talking about yourself!

09:56.700 --> 09:58.690
Oh, sorry, Fuyutsuki-san.

09:58.690 --> 10:01.320
We got carried away.

10:01.320 --> 10:05.320
It's okay... You just seemed to be having fun.

10:05.320 --> 10:07.120
We really weren't.

10:07.120 --> 10:09.830
Yeah, we totally weren't!

10:11.260 --> 10:12.840
I...

10:15.000 --> 10:17.140
I've never been in love before.

10:21.740 --> 10:24.320
Is that strange, at my age?

10:24.860 --> 10:28.660
No... I don't think so!

10:31.680 --> 10:35.360
<i>What does that make Himuro-kun, then?</i>

10:42.140 --> 10:44.370
It's a message from Himuro-kun.

10:44.950 --> 10:47.390
You're texting that often?

10:47.390 --> 10:49.630
What'd he say?!

10:49.630 --> 10:52.400
It's nothing, really.

10:52.910 --> 10:55.590
It seems they're all playing games together.

10:58.960 --> 11:00.720
<i>"It's nothing, really"...</i>

11:00.720 --> 11:02.140
<i>But that smile says...</i>

11:03.240 --> 11:05.860
<i>It's definitely </i>something<i>!</i>

11:07.140 --> 11:09.640
Oh, forget it!

11:09.640 --> 11:11.750
Let's get drunk!

11:11.750 --> 11:14.710
Otonashi-san! I wanna drink, too!

11:15.730 --> 11:16.790
Here!

11:20.400 --> 11:22.160
Okay. Ready?

11:27.200 --> 11:29.840
Cheers!

11:31.190 --> 11:33.170
<b></b>Alcohol

11:31.420 --> 11:33.170
<b></b>Fuyutsuki-san

11:31.420 --> 11:33.170
<b></b>You have a new message.

11:38.480 --> 11:40.610
What're you doing, Himuro?

11:40.610 --> 11:42.770
Did you get a reply?

11:42.770 --> 11:44.690
It's Fuyutsuki-san, right?

11:44.690 --> 11:46.690
Yes, but...

11:47.190 --> 11:49.810
It's just, you know...

11:49.810 --> 11:54.190
I don't want to creep her out
 by reading it too fast.

11:56.190 --> 12:01.700
<b>Green Tea</b>

11:56.190 --> 12:01.700
<b>Sayama</b>

11:56.200 --> 11:58.480
You don't need to strategize, man!

11:58.480 --> 12:01.690
When you're a businessman, 
the faster the reply, the better!

12:01.690 --> 12:05.170
Hey! Don't read it for me!

12:07.480 --> 12:08.700
What now?

12:09.260 --> 12:11.480
<i>Everyone drinking?</i>

12:11.480 --> 12:15.270
<i>The girls trio is having a blast!</i>

12:15.270 --> 12:16.720
<i>A blast.</i>

12:16.720 --> 12:18.720
<i>Yeah!</i>

12:18.720 --> 12:20.720
Are we in heaven?

12:20.720 --> 12:23.720
Seems like they're really having fun!

12:23.720 --> 12:25.870
I'd love to be there!

12:28.800 --> 12:30.720
I wish I were a girl.

12:32.220 --> 12:35.720
Wh-What do you mean by that?

12:35.720 --> 12:39.230
I think... I'm fine being a dude.

12:45.470 --> 12:47.020
Himuro!

12:47.020 --> 12:50.430
It's finally Fuyutsuki-san's birthday!

12:50.430 --> 12:54.530
You ready? Go for broke!

12:55.080 --> 12:57.270
I told you, I don't want to break.

12:58.700 --> 13:01.040
Get that snowball spirit!

13:06.110 --> 13:08.610
<i>Fuyutsuki-san's birthday...</i>

13:10.740 --> 13:13.110
<i>I gotta give 'em to her.</i>

13:19.220 --> 13:20.640
Fuyutsuki-san!

13:29.640 --> 13:31.070
<i>Huh?</i>

13:31.440 --> 13:32.810
<i>What the...</i>

13:32.810 --> 13:35.080
<i>All I did was call to her!</i>

13:38.410 --> 13:43.360
<i>Crud... I'm too dang nervous!</i>

13:43.360 --> 13:46.090
<i>No... no!</i>

13:46.090 --> 13:48.090
No!

13:50.690 --> 13:52.600
What an awful dream...

13:53.760 --> 13:55.590
<i>Relax.</i>

13:56.120 --> 13:58.710
<i>Gotta relax, Himuro.</i>

14:00.970 --> 14:04.460
Fuyutsuki-san, it's your birthday today?!

14:04.460 --> 14:05.600
Yes.

14:05.830 --> 14:09.600
Why didn't you say so earlier?

14:11.610 --> 14:14.090
<i>She really doesn't know what to say...</i>

14:14.800 --> 14:18.840
I just wanna know more about you!

14:18.840 --> 14:20.640
Really?

14:22.300 --> 14:26.670
Hey, how about we grab 
dinner together tonight?

14:28.310 --> 14:31.640
I'm sorry, I have plans for tonight.

14:33.650 --> 14:37.130
What?! Could it be... a date?!

14:38.400 --> 14:40.850
Oh, no. It's with my parents.

14:40.850 --> 14:42.890
I'm taking them to dinner.

14:42.890 --> 14:44.080
Oh!

14:44.080 --> 14:47.420
I see my birthday as a day to 
show gratitude to my parents.

14:48.310 --> 14:50.410
I'm sorry to disappoint you.

14:50.410 --> 14:52.550
Wow, is that it?

14:52.550 --> 14:54.410
You're so mature, Fuyutsuki-san!

14:56.980 --> 15:00.410
<i>I gotta give Fuyutsuki-san 
her present before she leaves!</i>

15:03.840 --> 15:05.380
Fuyu—

15:04.120 --> 15:05.380
Fuyutsuki-san.

15:05.370 --> 15:07.430
May I speak with you?

15:07.430 --> 15:08.520
Yes, sir.

15:08.520 --> 15:10.600
I'm so sorry about this.

15:10.600 --> 15:13.440
Those materials for tomorrow's conference...

15:13.670 --> 15:17.040
We received a rush request to add more on...

15:17.040 --> 15:19.460
Yes, sir. Please let me know what's needed.

15:27.200 --> 15:29.170
Fuyu—

15:27.560 --> 15:29.170
Really?

15:29.170 --> 15:32.210
It doesn't seem real, but it's true!

15:44.330 --> 15:46.560
Um, Fuyu—

15:45.330 --> 15:46.560
Himuro-kun.

15:48.210 --> 15:50.210
May I speak with you?

15:50.210 --> 15:51.910
Y-Yes, sir!

15:59.640 --> 16:01.650
Yes? Himuro speaking.

16:01.650 --> 16:03.200
Thank you for calling.

16:03.200 --> 16:06.430
Yes, I'll send those right away.

16:06.430 --> 16:08.730
Yes. Thank you.

16:11.420 --> 16:14.140
<i>I can't get a word in edgewise
 to Fuyutsuki-san!</i>

16:14.140 --> 16:15.240
Himuro-san.

16:15.240 --> 16:17.490
These are for you.

16:17.490 --> 16:18.870
Right...

16:25.440 --> 16:26.880
<i>Still...</i>

16:27.430 --> 16:29.630
<i>I've been watching her all day,</i>

16:30.190 --> 16:34.630
<i>and she really is beloved 
by the whole office.</i>

16:35.730 --> 16:40.060
<i>It makes me happy to see 
the girl I love is so popular.</i>

16:43.720 --> 16:45.480
<i>B-But...</i>

16:50.330 --> 16:52.640
<i>I can't back down yet!</i>

16:56.150 --> 16:57.650
Fuyutsuki-san.

16:58.670 --> 16:59.990
Himuro-kun.

17:00.510 --> 17:03.660
I'm glad to see you. 
I had a question for you.

17:05.990 --> 17:08.630
About the materials for
 tomorrow's conference...

17:08.630 --> 17:09.690
Yes?

17:10.060 --> 17:11.830
This part here.

17:12.170 --> 17:14.200
Oh, that?

17:14.760 --> 17:15.680
Well...

17:20.220 --> 17:22.740
Thank you for all your help.

17:22.740 --> 17:24.180
Not at all.

17:24.700 --> 17:26.840
The advice you give is so precise.

17:27.650 --> 17:30.190
You're so reliable, Himuro-kun.

17:37.770 --> 17:39.160
Himuro-kun?

17:42.830 --> 17:44.160
Fuyutsuki-san...

17:44.160 --> 17:45.200
Yes?

17:46.820 --> 17:50.210
Would you... walk home with me this evening?

18:08.370 --> 18:10.720
<i>When I really think about it,</i>

18:11.820 --> 18:14.230
<i>this present might be too much...</i>

18:15.220 --> 18:17.340
It's quite cold today, isn't it?

18:20.800 --> 18:27.400
<i>She really might think of me as nothing 
but another close colleague.</i>

18:27.400 --> 18:33.250
<i>If that's the case, is jewelry for 
her birthday really appropriate?</i>

18:35.830 --> 18:37.250
<i>I dunno.</i>

18:37.730 --> 18:41.260
<i>What'll make her happiest?</i>

18:43.230 --> 18:45.480
<i>I just dunno!</i>

19:10.280 --> 19:13.000
<i>Oh, crud!</i>

19:13.000 --> 19:16.120
<i>I froze the whole place outta nervousness!</i>

19:16.120 --> 19:17.630
Himuro-kun...

19:19.460 --> 19:23.050
This is amazing, Himuro-kun!

19:27.600 --> 19:30.730
Today is my birthday.

19:31.640 --> 19:37.530
Could I take this scenery 
as a birthday present?

19:37.530 --> 19:41.070
No, i-it's not.

19:41.640 --> 19:43.360
That's not your present.

19:45.500 --> 19:46.570
This is.

19:59.440 --> 20:01.580
May I open it?

20:22.720 --> 20:24.450
Snowflake earrings.

20:25.330 --> 20:29.000
I saw them and thought 
they'd look good on you,

20:29.000 --> 20:31.310
and I found myself buying them.

20:32.190 --> 20:34.130
I wanted to give them to you today.

20:35.570 --> 20:40.120
Fuyutsuki-san... Happy birthday.

20:41.920 --> 20:44.530
Snow that won't melt...

20:45.250 --> 20:47.560
They remind me of you.

20:57.200 --> 20:58.580
Himuro-kun...

21:01.320 --> 21:02.840
Do they look okay on me?

21:14.040 --> 21:17.110
They look great.

21:31.000 --> 21:32.700
<i>Um, Himuro-kun...</i>

21:32.700 --> 21:33.690
<i>Yes?</i>

21:35.200 --> 21:39.550
<i>I wonder what I should get 
you for your birthday.</i>

21:39.550 --> 21:43.140
<i>W-Well... er...</i>

21:43.980 --> 21:46.660
<i>I'll leave that up to you.</i>

21:46.660 --> 21:49.820
<i>All right. I'll think about it.</i>

23:28.360 --> 23:34.760
Um... would you like to live with me?
